# The queue is read before anything is pushed, so a queue that cannot be
# vouched for stops the claim rather than being claimed around.
run claim M1-01
exit 3
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/zzz.md
	---
	id: Z
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: maybe
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: tasks/zzz.md: exclusive must be yes or no, found: maybe
